{
    "title": "Flexmls For Homebuyers",
    "description": "** This app is for homebuyers and requires an invitation from your Realtor. Ask your Realtor if they use Flexmls and if they can send you an invitation today**\r\n\r\nThe Flexmls app connects you to your REALTOR\u00ae with the same accurate, comprehensive and up-to-date listing information that they rely on every day.  \r\n\r\nYou\u2019ve already made a great decision to work with a licensed REALTOR\u00ae. Realtors use their local knowledge and expertise to help guide you through your home search journey, and we designed the Flexmls app with this relationship in mind.\r\n\r\nSearch for homes, view beautiful photos, select your favorites, hide homes you don\u2019t like, and even directly message your Realtor - anytime and anywhere.  Search, collaborate and find your dream home with the Flexmls app.\r\n\r\n\r\n******\r\nFlexmls App Features:\r\n******\r\n\r\nThe Most Trusted Information Source\r\n\u2022 Accurate, reliable property information\r\n\u2022 Real-time data that provides the most up-to-date pricing and home details \r\n\u2022 Directly from the source (the MLS)\r\n\r\nEndless Search Options\r\n\u2022 Search homes by city, address, zip code or even MLS #\r\n\u2022 Filter your search by property type, bedrooms, bathrooms, square footage, list price, year built, and hundreds of other options\r\n\u2022 Draw your desired search area directly on the map to view homes for sale in that location or neighborhood\r\n\u2022 Search for homes in your desired school districts\r\n\u2022 View open house information or attend a live virtual open house (where available)\r\n\u2022 Sort your search results by price, new or recently changed, status, city, bedrooms or bathrooms\r\n\r\nHot Market? Customize Your Notifications\r\n\u2022 Subscribe to get instant email notifications of the types of homes you want to see\r\n\u2022 View your personalized news feed to review all the property updates you have received\r\n\t\r\nEasy To Use\r\n\u2022 Swipe through photos, videos, virtual tours, immersive 3D home tours (where offered) and documents \r\n\u2022 Save and rank your favorite homes and hide the ones you don\u2019t want to see\r\n\u2022 Beautiful, modern interface that's consistent with the home search you\u2019ll use on your computer\r\n\r\nCollaborate With Your Realtor\r\n\u2022 Quick and easy access to the home searches your Realtor created for you\r\n\u2022 Direct in-app messaging allows you to contact your Realtor to ask for more information, request a showing, and more\r\n\r\nInvolve Your Family & Friends\r\n\u2022 Quickly share listings you\u2019re excited about with your loved ones via text, email, and other sharing options that are available on your mobile device\r\n\u2022 Never get lost with quick access to turn-by-turn driving directions on every listing\r\n\r\nYour Flexmls app gives you what you need to find the home of your dreams! \r\n\r\nPlease contact your Realtor if you have problems accessing or using this app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "** This app is for homebuyers and requires an invitation from your Realtor. Ask your Realtor if they use Flexmls and if they can send you an invitation today**<br><br>The Flexmls app connects you to your REALTOR\u00ae with the same accurate, comprehensive and up-to-date listing information that they rely on every day.  <br><br>You\u2019ve already made a great decision to work with a licensed REALTOR\u00ae. Realtors use their local knowledge and expertise to help guide you through your home search journey, and we designed the Flexmls app with this relationship in mind.<br><br>Search for homes, view beautiful photos, select your favorites, hide homes you don\u2019t like, and even directly message your Realtor - anytime and anywhere.  Search, collaborate and find your dream home with the Flexmls app.<br><br><br>******<br>Flexmls App Features:<br>******<br><br>The Most Trusted Information Source<br>\u2022 Accurate, reliable property information<br>\u2022 Real-time data that provides the most up-to-date pricing and home details <br>\u2022 Directly from the source (the MLS)<br><br>Endless Search Options<br>\u2022 Search homes by city, address, zip code or even MLS #<br>\u2022 Filter your search by property type, bedrooms, bathrooms, square footage, list price, year built, and hundreds of other options<br>\u2022 Draw your desired search area directly on the map to view homes for sale in that location or neighborhood<br>\u2022 Search for homes in your desired school districts<br>\u2022 View open house information or attend a live virtual open house (where available)<br>\u2022 Sort your search results by price, new or recently changed, status, city, bedrooms or bathrooms<br><br>Hot Market? Customize Your Notifications<br>\u2022 Subscribe to get instant email notifications of the types of homes you want to see<br>\u2022 View your personalized news feed to review all the property updates you have received<br>\t<br>Easy To Use<br>\u2022 Swipe through photos, videos, virtual tours, immersive 3D home tours (where offered) and documents <br>\u2022 Save and rank your favorite homes and hide the ones you don\u2019t want to see<br>\u2022 Beautiful, modern interface that&#39;s consistent with the home search you\u2019ll use on your computer<br><br>Collaborate With Your Realtor<br>\u2022 Quick and easy access to the home searches your Realtor created for you<br>\u2022 Direct in-app messaging allows you to contact your Realtor to ask for more information, request a showing, and more<br><br>Involve Your Family &amp; Friends<br>\u2022 Quickly share listings you\u2019re excited about with your loved ones via text, email, and other sharing options that are available on your mobile device<br>\u2022 Never get lost with quick access to turn-by-turn driving directions on every listing<br><br>Your Flexmls app gives you what you need to find the home of your dreams! <br><br>Please contact your Realtor if you have problems accessing or using this app.",
